steps.prompt:
You are a senior engineer triaging a bug report. Based on the report below, output a JSON object with two keys: 'priority' (one of: P0 P1 P2 P3) and 'rationale' (one sentence explaining the priority). Do not add commentary outside the JSON object.

Report:
- Title: {{collect-report.title}}
- Severity: {{collect-report.severity}}
- Description: {{collect-report.description}}
- Component: {{collect-report.component}}
